        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading global manufacturer and marketer of a broad range of polyurethane chemicals, including MDI products, polyols and TPU (each discussed in more detail below under “Products and Markets”).",
