        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to extensive federal, state, local and international laws, regulations, rules and ordinances relating to occupational health and safety, process safety, pollution, protection of the environment and natural resources, product management and distribution, and the generation, storage, handling, transportation, treatment, disposal and remediation of hazardous substances and waste materials.",
